{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "no-longer-human",
  "chunk_id": "no-longer-human-chunk-0155",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00155",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "堀木年邁的父母和一位年輕的工匠，三人正在樓下敲敲打打地製作木屐帶。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Downstairs, Horiki's elderly parents and a young craftsman, the three of them, were noisily making sandal straps.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00155",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "那天，堀木讓我見識了他作為城市人嶄新的一面，就是俗話所說的老奸巨猾的一面。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That day, Horiki showed me a new side of himself as a city man, the side people call shrewd and calculating.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00155",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "他是令我這個鄉巴佬瞠目結舌的冷漠、狡猾的利己主義者，遠不是像我這樣的男人，漂泊不定，無家可歸。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He was a cold, cunning egotist who left a country bumpkin like me speechless, nothing at all like a man like me, drifting and homeless.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00155",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "「你太令我吃驚了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"You really astonish me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00155",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "你老爸原諒你了嗎？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Has your father forgiven you?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00155",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "還是沒有？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Or not yet?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00155",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "我沒敢說是逃出來的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I did not dare say that I had run away.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00155",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "我還是老一套，搪塞著敷衍。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As usual, I dodged the question and gave him an evasive answer.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00155",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "雖然肯定會馬上被堀木識破，但我依然敷衍。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Although Horiki was sure to see through me at once, I kept on dodging it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00155",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "「總會有辦法的。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Something will work out.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00155",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "「喂，這可不是鬧著玩的呀。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Hey, this is no laughing matter.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
